[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":167},["ShallowReactive",2],{"NJyK03WnujStby1Ab3AkQQGLLHFlEBESQsOz8A63XSc":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":42,"sector":43,"services":50,"introCopy":51,"storyblockAccordions":52,"storyblockAssets":62,"flexibleContent":86,"footerLinkLabel":159,"footerLinks":160},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Orée","Orée’s bold, Parisian chic design—defined by its signature blue facade—stands out effortlessly amidst the sea of high-street hipster coffee shops.",null,"oree",false,{"hex":11},"#D6F2FE",{"hex":13},"#CBA657","Stand out on a crowded high street by owning your heritage. A modern Boulangerie Pâtisserie.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Or&eacute;e\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":32,"height":30,"url":34,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":35},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":36,"srcSet":37,"src":38,"width":39,"height":40,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736942948-shed_oree_01143-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,1800,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","UK",[44,47],{"slug":45,"label":46},"hospitality","Hospitality",{"slug":48,"label":49},"heritage","Heritage","Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A bold, clean take on Parisian chic characterised by the brand&rsquo;s signature blue facade. Or&eacute;e is instantly recognisable and stands out from a slurry of hipster coffee shops so prevalent on the high street. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[53,56,59],{"title":54,"copy":55},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Shed was asked to design a new concept for this French artisan patisserie boulangerie. As a newcomer to the high-street Or&eacute;e needed to carve out its own unique niche within a busy London market and launch with aplomb. \u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":57,"copy":58},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjc3NjU0OTMwMSwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>The strategy was simple: Stand out from the crowd by owning your heritage. A bold, clean look characterised by the brand&rsquo;s signature blue facade, with a look and feel that \u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjk2MjQyMDczMSwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-buffer=\"&lt;!--(figma)(/figma)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>unapologetically leant into authentic French details.&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":60,"copy":61},"The Solution","\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>The result is a series of stand out, instantly recognisable design features. The perfect balance of freshness and quality inspired by the product, paired with a comfortable hospitality feel that you want to spend time in. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>",[63,73,83],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":64},{"width":65,"height":66,"url":67,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":68},2094,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":69,"srcSet":70,"src":71,"width":65,"height":66,"sizes":72},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00868-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738756051-shed_oree_00